    "summary": "Turquoise and silver bracelet composed of three clusters of turquoise: a centre cluster of two concentric circles of twenty and eleven tear-drop turquoises respectively around a single oval shaped one; and two semi-circular clusters with nine around three tear-drop shaped turquoise. All three clusters are enhanced with silver beads and the design highlighted with twisted silver wire. These are mounted on flat silver sheet itself soldered to four bands of half round wire. The ends of the bracelet are flat and rectangular. Back of bracelet has two pen marks: &quot;Lone MT&quot; and &quot;Ondelancy&quot;, and two letters scratched: &quot;RB&quot;.",
